    "detailed_description": "Enter the world of Volleyhalla, a hectic, frantic &quot;battle-tennis&quot; game. Defend the flock, destroy evil.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874690/extras/ca3dcf433639b2d2d6a4b1f69b1ec5d8.avif?t=1725570365\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Engage in ritualized barbarian shepherd combat, which coincidentally happens to look a <i>little bit</i> like ping pong.<br></li><li> As the last Battle Shepherd, it's up to you to guard your herd from marauding beasts and harvest wool to trade for essential resources.<br></li><li> With each victory, you'll restore your land and uncover ancient secrets hidden beneath the soil. <br></li><li> Along the way, unlock unique characters who bring their own skills and stories to your journey.<br></li><li> Find and purchase new Weapons and Shields to complement your playstyle and vanquish your foes.<br></li><li> Wield unique Magics to give you an edge over your ruthless opponents and turn the tide.<br></li><li> Your destiny is to rebuild, protect, and save Volley Valley\u2014will you rise to the challenge?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874690/extras/b5ca7d8da91123dbbead265ca689fe1a.avif?t=1725570365\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></li><li> A lovingly realized pixel art barbarian sheep-herding world.<br></li><li> Story mode campaign, with a rich overworld.<br></li><li> Local two-player versus and co-op.<br></li><li> Controller support.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the world of Volleyhalla, a hectic, frantic &quot;battle-tennis&quot; game. Defend the flock, destroy evil.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874690/extras/ca3dcf433639b2d2d6a4b1f69b1ec5d8.avif?t=1725570365\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Engage in ritualized barbarian shepherd combat, which coincidentally happens to look a <i>little bit</i> like ping pong.<br></li><li> As the last Battle Shepherd, it's up to you to guard your herd from marauding beasts and harvest wool to trade for essential resources.<br></li><li> With each victory, you'll restore your land and uncover ancient secrets hidden beneath the soil. <br></li><li> Along the way, unlock unique characters who bring their own skills and stories to your journey.<br></li><li> Find and purchase new Weapons and Shields to complement your playstyle and vanquish your foes.<br></li><li> Wield unique Magics to give you an edge over your ruthless opponents and turn the tide.<br></li><li> Your destiny is to rebuild, protect, and save Volley Valley\u2014will you rise to the challenge?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1874690/extras/b5ca7d8da91123dbbead265ca689fe1a.avif?t=1725570365\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2></li><li> A lovingly realized pixel art barbarian sheep-herding world.<br></li><li> Story mode campaign, with a rich overworld.<br></li><li> Local two-player versus and co-op.<br></li><li> Controller support.</li></ul>",
